{
  "description": "Shared test vectors of the Strybok SDK contract, section \"Links without an API call\". Every SDK keeps a byte-identical copy of this file next to its tests and runs every case. Each lookup case gives the SDK allowedHosts (above), the parameterLinks option (null: the option is not set) and the tapped url; lookup is the exact URL the SDK puts into the url parameter of resolve (before that parameter is percent-encoded), or null when the URL is not ours: the automatic flow drops it without a request and resolve() fails with UnsupportedLink. Each configuration case says whether an SDK accepts that parameterLinks option; an invalid one is a configuration error.",
